{"role":"assistant","content":"The logs show three independent failures: the browser’s link drops the auth header, the scope list names the same areas twice, and the app invents a one-hour expiry even though Intervals does not return one. The token exchange also sends fields this provider does not expect.","tool_calls":[{"type":"function","id":"tool_Cew7bprDrsYgeFQ4lMwp5KPK","function":{"name":"TodoList","arguments":"{\"todos\":[{\"title\":\"Inspect OAuth flow and failure logs\",\"status\":\"done\"},{\"title\":\"Fix connection and token handling\",\"status\":\"in_progress\"},{\"title\":\"Verify the integration end to end\",\"status\":\"pending\"},{\"title\":\"Document causes and applicable note parts\",\"status\":\"pending\"}]}"}}]}
