{"role":"assistant","content":"Fixed the Intervals.icu integration:\n\n- Connect now uses an authenticated POST followed by frontend navigation.\n- Removed duplicate scope areas.\n- Corrected the token exchange to send only the three supported fields.\n- Removed the false one-hour expiry and refresh worker.\n- API 401 responses now clear the token and request reconnection.\n- Added signed, expiring JWT state and athlete-mismatch protection.\n\nRoot causes, changes, and applicable parts of the colleague’s note are documented in `ANSWER.md`.\n\nPython/JavaScript syntax checks and an end-to-end local test with a fake Intervals.icu provider passed. No live provider test was run because external calls were prohibited and the configured credentials are placeholders."}
